      "writtenOn": "2024-07-01T20:35:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This callback could return a socket FD that it releases ownership of, and we can have a simple local implementation of IAccessor that can provide the FD when needed to reuse the code (or some other way in libbinder).",
